#N canvas 180 180 1600 320 12;
#X text 20 10 Drum slot: plays one of the 8 drum sounds (ockm-<slot>-sound 0-7) \, or a sample when ockm-<slot>-sample is 1 or more. Only the one in use runs. ockm-<slot>-audition plays it once.;
